msgstr "若您希望某些任务键退出缓存，可按以下方式设置缓存级别："

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:145
msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:152
msgid "Per-task opt-out"
msgstr "按任务退出"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:154
msgid ""
"To opt out of the cache individually, use `Def.uncached(...)` as follows:"
msgstr "要单独退出缓存，请按以下方式使用 `Def.uncached(...)`："

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:164
msgid "Build-wide opt-out"
msgstr "构建级退出"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:166
msgid ""
"To opt out of by-default custom task caching, add the following to `project/"
"plugins.sbt`:"
msgstr ""
"要选择退出默认的自定义任务缓存，请在 `project/plugins.sbt` 中添加以下内容："

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:169
msgid "\"-Xmacro-settings:sbt:no-default-task-cache\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:172
msgid ""
"```admonish note\n"
"This applies only to the custom tasks introduced in the build. Any cached "
"tasks provided by sbt or plugins will remain cached.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```admonish note\n"
"此设置仅适用于构建中引入的自定义任务。sbt 或插件提供的任何缓存任务仍将保持缓"
"存。\n"
"```"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:176
msgid "Remote caching"
msgstr "远程缓存"

#: src/reference/reference/cached-task.md:179
msgid ""
"sbt 2.x implements Bazel-compatible gRPC interface, which works with number "
"of backend both open source and commercial. See [Remote cache setup](./"
"remote-cache-setup.md) for more details."
msgstr ""
"sbt 2.x 实现了 Bazel 兼容的 gRPC 接口，可与多种开源和商业后端配合使用。详见 "
"[Remote cache setup](./remote-cache-setup.md)。"
